- [ ] Add imports: Page from '@playwright/test'
- [ ] Define PLP_SELECTORS object structure

#### Pass 2: Implementation [ ]
- [ ] Add data-testid selectors:
  - productGrid: '[data-testid="product-grid"]'
  - productCard: '[data-testid="product-card"]'
  - emptyProducts: '[data-testid="empty-products"]'
  - filterSidebar: '[data-testid="filter-sidebar"]'
  - sortDropdown: '[data-testid="sort-dropdown"]'
  - mobileFilterButton: 'button:has-text("Filters")'
  - mobileFilterDrawer: '[data-testid="mobile-filter-drawer"]'
- [ ] Add navigateToCategory(page, slug) function
- [ ] Add getProductCount(page) function
- [ ] Add TEST_CATEGORIES constant:
  - openBack: 'headphones/open-back'
  - closedBack: 'headphones/closed-back'
  - invalid: 'non-existent-12345'
- [ ] Add viewports constant:
  - desktop: { width: 1280, height: 720 }
  - mobile: { width: 375, height: 844 }

#### Pass 3: Verification [ ]
- [ ] TypeScript compiles without errors
- [ ] All exports are defined

**Build Gate:** `npx tsc --noEmit tests/utils/products-page-helpers.ts`

