## Phase 3: E2E (SC3) — PENDING

### SC3: E2E Critical Flows — G-03 Coverage
**File:** `tests/e2e/products-page/critical-flows.spec.ts`

#### Pass 1: Skeleton [ ]
- [ ] Create file with imports (test, expect from '@playwright/test')
- [ ] Import helpers from '../utils/products-page-helpers'
- [ ] Add test.describe('Products Page Critical Flows')
- [ ] Add beforeEach for console error capture

#### Pass 2: Tests [ ]

**E2E-01: Category page loads and displays products [ ]**
- [ ] Navigate to /products/headphones/open-back
- [ ] Assert: product-grid visible
- [ ] Assert: h1 contains 'Open-Back'
- [ ] Assert: at least 1 product-card visible

**E2E-02: Invalid category slug shows 404 [ ]**
- [ ] Navigate to /products/non-existent-12345
- [ ] Assert: 404 text or 'Not Found' visible

**E2E-03: Empty category shows "no products" message [ ]**
- [ ] Navigate to empty category (find or mock)
- [ ] Assert: empty-products visible
- [ ] Assert: 'no products found' text present

**E2E-04: Mobile filter drawer opens and closes [ ]**
- [ ] Set viewport: 375×844
- [ ] Navigate to category
- [ ] Click Filters button
- [ ] Assert: mobile-filter-drawer visible
- [ ] Click Done button
- [ ] Assert: mobile-filter-drawer not visible

**E2E-05: Sort selection updates URL and results [ ]**
- [ ] Navigate to category
- [ ] Get initial first product name
- [ ] Select 'Price: High to Low' from sort dropdown
- [ ] Assert: URL contains 'sort=displayPrice:desc'
- [ ] Assert: product-grid still visible (re-rendered)

**E2E-06: Loading skeleton visible during data fetch [ ]**
- [ ] Navigate to category with slow 3G throttling (if possible)
- [ ] OR verify skeleton structure exists in loading.tsx
- [ ] Assert: skeleton structure renders before products

#### Pass 3: RWD Layer 2 (Desktop) [ ]
- [ ] Run all tests at 1280×720
- [ ] All 6 tests pass

#### Pass 3: RWD Layer 2 (Mobile) [ ]
- [ ] Run E2E-04 at 375×844
- [ ] Test passes

#### Pass 3: Layer 3 (Surface) [ ]
- [ ] Screenshot capture for manual review (optional)

#### Pass 3: Layer 4 (Interaction) [ ]
- [ ] CI execution time < 90 seconds for all 6 tests

**Build Gate:** `npx playwright test tests/e2e/products-page/critical-flows.spec.ts --reporter=list`

