## Delegation Commands

```bash
# Execute SC1
/implement "Create tests/utils/products-page-helpers.ts with PLP_SELECTORS including product-grid, product-card, empty-products, filter-sidebar, sort-dropdown, mobile-filter-drawer, plus navigateToCategory function, TEST_CATEGORIES constant with openBack, closedBack, invalid, and viewports for desktop and mobile"

# Execute SC2 - Part 1
/implement "Create tests/integration/products/ProductGrid.integration.test.tsx with two tests: renders products with correct data (mock 2 products, verify grid and cards visible), and shows empty state when no products (verify empty-products testid and no products found message)"

# Execute SC2 - Part 2
/implement "Create tests/integration/products/CategoryPageClient.integration.test.tsx with one test: displays correct product count with pluralization (test 42 products vs 1 product text)"

# Execute SC3
/implement "Create tests/e2e/products-page/critical-flows.spec.ts with 6 Playwright tests: (1) category loads products and shows grid, (2) invalid slug shows 404, (3) empty category shows no products message, (4) mobile filter drawer opens and closes at 375px, (5) sort updates URL to include sort param, (6) loading skeleton visible during data fetch. Import helpers from products-page-helpers."

# Verify each phase
/test --file tests/utils/products-page-helpers.ts
test --suite integration/products
test --suite e2e/products-page

# Final verification
test --suite all
```

